["    The locale is fixed for the lifetime of the returned instance. Passing a different `locale` for an","    already initialized `channelKey` has no effect - call `Zendesk.invalidate()` first, then `initialize`","    with the new locale.","","    Backend content — bot replies, settings and campaigns — follows this locale, as does the","    UIKit messaging interface (labels, buttons, error messages, VoiceOver descriptions, dates and","    plural forms). Lookup falls back from an exact match (`\"en-AU\"`) to the closest available","    translation (`\"en-GB\"`) and finally to the SDK's built-in English. Your app's own string","    overrides in `Bundle.main` continue to take precedence for the chosen locale.","","    Some things deliberately keep following the device: layout *direction*, Help Center article","    *content*, the Zendesk Voice SDK interface, and regional formatting (calendar, number separators,","    file-size units)."]}]},{"name":"completionHandler","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A block that takes a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Result","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" enum type. In the case of a success, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Zendesk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance will be returned, in the case of a failure an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"text":" type.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Attention","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method must complete successfully before "},{"code":"Zendesk.instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can be called."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"After a successful call has been made, calling it again with the same "},{"code":"channelKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" will succeed immediately"},{"type":"t